  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0428.medeia.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0428.medeia.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0428.medeia.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0428_medeia"><head>ΜΗΔΕΙΑ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" author_heading="CANTHARUS" work_heading="ΜΗΔΕΙΑ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0428-medeia-1">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0428-medeia-1-l1">Κιθαρῳδὸν ἐξηγείρατ᾽ Ἀράβιον χορόν.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Suidas v. Ἀράβιος ἄγγελος. καὶ Ἀράβιος αὐλητὴς ἐπὶ τῶν ἀκαταπαύστων. Κάνθαρος Μηδείᾳ Κιθαρῳδὸν ἐξηγείρατ᾽ Ἀράβιον τὸν χορὸν τοῦτον.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Ita codd. et Apostolius IV 22 pro vulgato olim ἐξηγείρατο. Articulum τὸν delendum esse vidit Iacobsius (v. ad Menandri Fragm. p. 19), τοῦτον Bernhardius. Hoc dicit: chorum excitastis Arabii citharoedi instar nunquam cantare desinentem. Nisi forte malis Κιθαρῳδὸν ἐξήγειρ᾽ Ἀράβιον τὸν χορὸν | τοῦτον. Proverbio Ἀράβιος αὐλητής usus est etiam Libanius vol. IV p. 143 Rsk. et Theoph. Simoc. Epist. p. 71.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" author_heading="CANTHARUS" work_heading="ΜΗΔΕΙΑ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0428-medeia-2">
              <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 85 10. Βαυβᾶν: ἀντὶ τοῦ καθείδειν. Εὐριπίδης Συλεῖ. — Κάνθαρος Μηδείᾳ βαυβήσομεν.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" author_heading="CANTHARUS" work_heading="ΜΗΔΕΙΑ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0428-medeia-3">
              <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 85 30. Βαρύσταθμον: Κάνθαρος Μηδείᾳ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Habet etiam Aristophanes Ran. 1443. Cfr Pollux IV 172.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" author_heading="CANTHARUS" work_heading="ΜΗΔΕΙΑ" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0428-medeia-4">
              <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 97 10. Ἐλᾶν: ἀντὶ τοῦ ἐλαύνειν. Κάνθαρος Μηδείᾳ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Atticistae requirebant ἐλαύνειν, ἐλᾶν ab Atticis non nisi de futuro dici existimantibus. Habet tamen etiam Euripides Phaeth. V 2.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>